*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%================================================
*%  Brother HL-5170DN - Custom PCL/PJL Driver
*%  Designed for Raspberry Pi CUPS print server
*%  Rendering: host-side (Ghostscript ljet4)
*%  Printer control: PJL commands in job header
*%================================================

*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.00"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*PCFileName: "BR5170DN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*Product: "(Brother HL-5170DN series)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 1"
*ModelName: "Brother HL-5170DN PCL"
*NickName: "Brother HL-5170DN PCL (PJL)"
*ShortNickName: "Brother HL-5170DN PCL"

*%==== CUPS Filter ============================
*% This filter handles: PCL 5e passthrough (cost 0), PDF, PostScript, PWG Raster → PCL via Ghostscript
*cupsVersion: 1.1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 71
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.hp-PCL 0 brother-hl5170dn-pjl"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-postscript 150 brother-hl5170dn-pjl"
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 200 brother-hl5170dn-pjl"
*cupsFilter: "image/pwg-raster 150 brother-hl5170dn-pjl"

*%==== Basic Device Capabilities ==============
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "16"
*FreeVM: "1700000"

*%==== Installable Options ====================
*OpenGroup: InstallableOptions/Options Installed
*OpenUI *OptionTrays/Number of Input Trays: PickOne
*DefaultOptionTrays: 2Trays
*OptionTrays 1Trays/1 Tray: ""
*OptionTrays 2Trays/2 Trays: ""
*CloseUI: *OptionTrays
*CloseGroup: InstallableOptions

*UIConstraints: *OptionTrays 1Trays *InputSlot TRAY2

*%==== Paper Sizes ============================
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/Letter: ""
*PageSize Legal/Legal: ""
*PageSize Executive/Executive: ""
*PageSize A4/A4: ""
*PageSize A5/A5: ""
*PageSize A6/A6: ""
*PageSize Env10/Com-10 Envelope: ""
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Monarch Envelope: ""
*PageSize EnvDL/DL Envelope: ""
*PageSize EnvC5/C5 Envelope: ""
*PageSize EnvISOB5/B5 Envelope: ""
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: ""
*PageRegion Legal/Legal: ""
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: ""
*PageRegion A4/A4: ""
*PageRegion A5/A5: ""
*PageRegion A6/A6: ""
*PageRegion Env10/Com-10 Envelope: ""
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Monarch Envelope: ""
*PageRegion EnvDL/DL Envelope: ""
*PageRegion EnvC5/C5 Envelope: ""
*PageRegion EnvISOB5/B5 Envelope: ""
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter:       "18 12 594 780"
*ImageableArea Legal/Legal:         "18 12 594 996"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "18 12 504 744"
*ImageableArea A4/A4:               "18 12 577 830"
*ImageableArea A5/A5:               "18 12 403 583"
*ImageableArea A6/A6:               "18 12 279 408"
*ImageableArea Env10/Com-10:        "18 12 279 672"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch/Monarch:  "18 12 261 528"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/DL:            "18 12 294 612"
*ImageableArea EnvC5/C5:            "18 12 441 637"
*ImageableArea EnvISOB5/B5:         "18 12 463 697"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter:       "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/Legal:         "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A4/A4:               "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5:               "420 595"
*PaperDimension A6/A6:               "297 420"
*PaperDimension Env10/Com-10:        "297 684"
*PaperDimension EnvMonarch/Monarch:  "279 540"
*PaperDimension EnvDL/DL:            "312 624"
*PaperDimension EnvC5/C5:            "459 649"
*PaperDimension EnvISOB5/B5:         "499 709"

*%==== Input Tray / Media Type ================
*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: AUTO
*InputSlot AUTO/Auto Select: ""
*InputSlot MPTRAY/MP Tray: ""
*InputSlot TRAY1/Tray 1: ""
*InputSlot TRAY2/Tray 2: ""
*InputSlot MANUAL/Manual Feed: ""
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: PLAIN
*MediaType PLAIN/Plain Paper: ""
*MediaType THIN/Thin Paper: ""
*MediaType THICK/Thick Paper: ""
*MediaType THICKER/Thicker Paper: ""
*MediaType BOND/Bond Paper: ""
*MediaType ENV/Envelopes: ""
*MediaType ENVTHICK/Thick Envelopes: ""
*MediaType ENVTHIN/Thin Envelopes: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*%==== Resolution =============================
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: ""
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: ""
*Resolution 1200dpi/HQ1200 (2400x600): ""
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*%==== Toner Save =============================
*OpenUI *TonerSave/Toner Save: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *TonerSave
*DefaultTonerSave: OFF
*TonerSave OFF/Off: ""
*TonerSave ON/On: ""
*CloseUI: *TonerSave

*%==== Duplex =================================
*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off (Single-Sided): ""
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long Edge (Portrait): ""
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short Edge (Landscape): ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*%==== IPP/AirPrint attribute hints ==========
*% These allow AirPrint clients to see capabilities
*cupsIPPSupplied: True
*cupsSides: two-sided-long-edge two-sided-short-edge one-sided

*%==== Default Font ===========================
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Special "(001.007S)" Special ROM

*% End of PPD
